WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,720
Sister is dead

2
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:08,720
Why do you keep checking her up?

3
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:11,700
My parents and brothers have already accepted it.

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,920
Let me marry you for my sister

5
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:21,490
Brother Mo

6
00:00:21,490 --> 00:00:23,490
I have liked you for so many years

7
00:00:23,490 --> 00:00:25,490
Before my sister came back

8
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:27,990
Everyone thinks that I will be the one to marry you in the future.

9
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:30,990
Now that my sister is gone,

10
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:33,150
Just forget about sister

11
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:35,150
I will love you well

12
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:37,650
I will definitely be more suitable for you than my sister, okay?

13
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:39,150
Shen Zhenzhu

14
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:41,070
Positioning has been restored

15
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:42,070
You and Shen Nian went there

16
00:00:42,070 --> 00:00:44,070
It's not an end at all, right?

17
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:46,070
why are you lying

18
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:47,070
Brother Mo

19
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:48,070
I don't understand what you are saying

20
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:49,070
Anyway

21
00:00:49,070 --> 00:00:50,070
It is a fact that my sister is dead

22
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:52,070
No matter how persistent you are, there’s no point in it anymore.

23
00:00:52,070 --> 00:00:53,070
Brother Mo

24
00:00:53,070 --> 00:00:54,070
Isn't it good to be with me?

25
00:00:54,070 --> 00:00:55,070
She feels guilty

26
00:00:55,070 --> 00:00:57,070
Sure enough, she concealed her true location

27
00:00:57,070 --> 00:00:58,070
Things about Shen Nian

28
00:00:58,070 --> 00:01:00,070
Sure enough, we can't get away from her.

29
00:01:00,070 --> 00:01:01,070
your words

30
00:01:01,070 --> 00:01:05,210
I will consider

31
00:01:05,210 --> 00:01:07,210
Han Shi and Shen Shi have cooperated for many years

32
00:01:07,210 --> 00:01:09,210
Marriage is something you must think about deeply

33
00:01:09,210 --> 00:01:11,210
I don’t believe that Brother Mo will do it because of you

34
00:01:11,210 --> 00:01:12,210
Give up the marriage between the two families

35
00:01:12,210 --> 00:01:14,950
Will definitely marry me

36
00:01:14,950 --> 00:01:20,530
Send personnel to expand helicopter search area

37
00:01:20,530 --> 00:01:22,530
Search in restricted sea areas

38
00:01:22,530 --> 00:01:29,320
The stalemate cannot continue any longer

39
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:33,370
Go back to find Shen Zhenzhu to settle accounts
